id=xring_o3_mali_host
name=XRING-O3 MaliBridge Host
version=2026.11.08
versionCode=20261108
author=collegeming
description=Android host-side MaliBridge payload for Xiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max (XRING-O3): vkbridge-server plus host scripts. Starts at boot by default (AUTOSTART=1); disables the legacy malibridge module. Userspace KernelSU module; no kernel or SELinux changes.
